WEBVTT

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.880
Eat up, and feel better.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.190
I understand the pain of losing your family.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.300
Because I had an ally named Ute, 
I'm standing here right now.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:21.930
I have allies besides Ute!

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.640
I forged strong bonds with new allies, also.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.780
By meeting them, I learned 
the importance of allies!

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:32.490
What?

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.770
What's wrong, dear?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.620
Syun risked his life in a duel, to tell 
Kaito about the importance of allies.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:48.780
While I didn't have the courage 
to step forward to save Ruri.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.340
So I swear that I'll bring Kaito back!

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.330
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:02.110
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:07.370
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:46.010
The Duel-Starved Amazonesses

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:50.460
Find her?

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.500
No...

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.080
Where did she go?

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.140
Wait!

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:57.840
Watch where you're standing!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.200
I'll go with you.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.060
Sayaka's probably looking for Kaito!

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.260
Stay out of this, outsider!

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:08.360
I don't know if Ute's really alive inside you,

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:12.170
but I haven't acknowledged you as an ally yet.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:23.080
Allen still thinks Dad ran away 
and abandoned them...

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.890
Why are you standing around?

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:28.720
We'll leave the base's protection 
to our Resistance allies.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.320
We, the Lancers, should go 
to save Sayaka.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.760
Sawatari! Gongenzaka!

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.820
Stop standing around.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:40.670
What was that? Who made you leader?!

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.360
We'll split into two teams.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:45.400
Yuya, you're with me. All right?

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:47.580
Kurosaki...

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:56.010
One is unlikely to find a single Heartland 
resident, simply walking around.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:59.640
And you don't look like you're one of us.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:01.950
Then, is she with the Lancers?

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.690
We are lucky to find our target 
so soon after arrival, Grace.

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.720
Yes, before we head to the 
commander's office,

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.930
let's bring a souvenir to Edo and 
Manoro, my dear sister Gloria.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:14.790
Sayaka!

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:16.520
Allen!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.870
Get out of here! I'll handle them!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:22.880
Ah, it appears she has a friend.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.840
Then we shall get two cards as souvenirs.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:29.070
Shut up! I'll protect Sayaka!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.960
What are you doing? Get going!

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.120
B-But...

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.850
Just run away!

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.840
No.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.720
I don't want to run and regret it again!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.480
Wha? What are you—

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.360
Sounds good... Let us 
fight a tag-team duel.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:44.700
Both our teams together,

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:45.630
right?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.460
Yes.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.680
A two-on-two tag duel.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:53.170
With the rule that teams share a 
field, life, and graveyard.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:54.750
I accept.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.540
Are you serious?!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.640
Yes, I've made up my mind.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.350
No matter what, I won't run again.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.820
I'll have courage and stand tall!

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:14.890
Then I'll join you!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.400
A real fight... It's been so long.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.270
I can't wait.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.270
Duel!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.950
I'll go first.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:31.610
I summon Ruffian Railcar from my hand!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.070
Lead-off Punch!

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:37.680
In exchange for not doing battle,

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:40.220
Ruffian Railcar can deal 500 
points of damage to you!

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:48.110
My, my... What a lively little boy.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.400
I guess that's how he says, "Hello."

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:55.050
I bet you lowered your guard, thinking I 
couldn't attack on my first turn.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:56.840
I now end my turn.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.280
I'd never lower my guard during 
my return to the battlefield.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:03.710
My turn!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:07.950
When I have Amazoness cards in my hand,

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.560
I can Special Summon Amazoness Spy!

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:15.750
And I tribute Amazoness Spy...

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.690
To Tribute Summon Level 6 
Amazoness Queen!

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:25.490
Battle.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:29.530
Amazoness Queen attacks Ruffian Railcar!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.240
In that instant, I activate the monster effect

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.840
of Construction Train Signal Red in my hand!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:41.780
I can Special Summon this card, 
and switch your attack target to it!

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:45.320
Then, I shall have to destroy it.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.290
Signal Red can't be destroyed in this battle!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:52.270
Oh? Not bad.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:56.220
But they still haven't used that 
"Pendulum Summon" method...

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:59.770
What? Then we'll have to force their hand.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.770
I end my turn!

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.940
Great. All according to plan, so far.

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:08.520
I dealt damage to her, and also 
blocked her attack.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.880
Sayaka, our field is shared.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.600
You can use my monster however you want.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:14.750
R-Right.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.020
Now, go! It's your turn!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:22.820
I need to destroy Amazoness Queen, 
which has 2400 attack points.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:24.960
My turn!

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:29.260
It's okay! This is all according 
to my plan, too!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.200
I summon Little Fairy!

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:41.730
And I discard one card to 
activate its monster effect!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.280
I increase Little Fairy's level by 1.

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:48.380
Then, I activate my spell card Fairy Dust

00:07:48.380 --> 00:07:51.630
to change Signal Red from 
Machine-Type to Fairy-Type

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.510
and increase its level by 1!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.720
There... Now, you've got two Level 4s!

00:07:56.720 --> 00:08:02.060
I overlay Level 4 Little Fairy and Signal Red!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:08.500
Let the angel smile upon the heroes 
who never stop fighting.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:10.200
Xyz Summon!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.600
Appear, Rank 4...

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:15.240
Fairy Cheer Girl!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.950
Since Signal Red, targeted by Fairy Dust,

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.040
was used as an Xyz component,

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.350
it increases Fairy Cheer Girl's 
attack points by 500!

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:28.170
Looking good.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.190
Keep it up, Sayaka!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.360
She got us...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.430
With 500 more attack points, they're 2400.

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:39.270
The same number of attack points 
as Amazoness Queen has.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:41.430
Why aren't they using Pendulum?

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:44.170
I wonder if they're underestimating us.

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:47.140
That makes me all the happier.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:50.460
Yes, more worth crushing.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.130
But if we're wrong...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:59.020
Fairy Dust will negate Fairy Cheer
 Girl's destruction by battle,

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.940
so they won't take each other out.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:06.150
First, I'll destroy their monster. 
Then I'll attack directly.

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:07.790
Battle!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:11.320
Fairy Cheer Girl attacks Amazoness Queen!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.230
As long as Amazoness Queen is on the field,

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:18.600
Amazoness monsters cannot 
be destroyed by battle!

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.200
It seems we were wrong.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.680
Yes.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.590
The ones the Professor sent us all 
the way to this dimension to beat

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:30.420
wouldn't be this pathetic.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.120
What do you mean by "pathetic"?!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.250
It means you're weak opponents.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.090
And weak in the head, too.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.060
Why, you...

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.810
After all, that girl lacked the brains

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.830
to consider what our monster's 
effect might be, didn't she?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.030
Sayaka!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.790
It's still your turn.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:53.930
There are still things you can do, right?

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:56.270
Things I can do... I...

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:59.240
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:00.850
No!

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.150
Your Fairy Cheer Girl's effect

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:09.220
lets you use one Overlay Unit 
per turn to draw!

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:13.520
You just gave up your chance to 
get a new card in your hand!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.460
I-I'm sorry.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.630
Well, it's okay.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.500
I'll work hard next turn.

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.400
If you get a next turn.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.170
What?

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:27.320
If you aren't with the Lancers, 
are you Resistance remnants?

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.760
What if we are?

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:31.180
Don't you know who we are?

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:34.280
If you don't, we'll tell you.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.970
The terror of the Tyler sisters...

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:40.250
...and their tag-team duel!

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.370
The Tyler sisters?

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:53.100
The Tyler sisters?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.350
The ones who brought

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:58.900
the Resistance's Spade Branch to 
the verge of total destruction?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:10:59.970
Oh, no...

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:01.710
My turn!

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:06.810
I activate spell card The Warrior 
Returning Alive from my hand!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:11.550
I return Amazoness Spy from my 
graveyard, and add it to my hand.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:15.280
And I activate my spell card Polymerization,

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:20.160
to fuse the Amazoness Tiger in my 
hand with Amazoness Spy.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.420
Jungle beast, with bared claws,

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.790
take on the warrior's eyes who hunts for prey,

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.130
and return as a new ferocious beast!

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.270
Fusion Summon!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.640
Appear,

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:35.130
Level 9 Amazoness Pet Liger!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:40.850
Battle... Amazoness Pet Liger 
attacks Fairy Cheer Girl!

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:45.480
When Liger attacks, its attack 
points increase by 500!

00:11:48.590 --> 00:11:52.520
Fairy Dust's effect prevents Fairy Cheer 
Girl from being destroyed by battle!

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:54.760
But you still take damage!

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:01.290
I also activate Liger's monster effect!

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:05.480
After damage calculation, the attack 
points of a monster

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:08.940
that did battle with an Amazoness 
are reduced by 800!

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:13.900
After battle, Liger's attack 
points return to normal.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.750
But it isn't over yet.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:21.020
I attack Fairy Cheer Girl with 
Amazoness Queen!

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:25.140
Fairy Dust's effect prevents Fairy Cheer Girl—

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.620
From destruction, yes?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:35.880
Then, Liger's effect reduces Fairy 
Cheer Girl's attack points

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.280
by another 800!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.940
Why do you keep dumping 
on Fairy Cheer Girl?!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:44.380
You cannot tell even that much?

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:46.480
Because you're so boring...

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.910
You two aren't any kind of challenge.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:51.780
So you're just playing with us?

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.940
Watch!

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:56.790
On my turn, I'll repay this debt, with interest!

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.120
He talks big, doesn't he?

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.890
Talk is cheap, after all.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.650
I activate my Continuous Spell 
Amazoness Magic Mirror!

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:09.900
It negates effect damage from your cards,

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:13.000
and deals the same amount 
of damage back to you.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.970
Now, your Railcar's effect is sealed, as well.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:20.720
Do try to repay me, if you can.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:22.710
With ten- or a hundred-fold interest.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.460
Damn...

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:29.290
I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:31.480
Allen...

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:35.470
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:36.760
Sayaka...

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:40.470
I swore I'd be brave and fight.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.480
But I rushed forward, emotionally.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:46.730
I'm just... dragging you down—

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:47.940
What are you talking about?!

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.320
We haven't lost yet.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.160
We're only getting started.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:54.950
My turn!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:59.160
I summon Express Train Trolley Olley!

00:14:00.390 --> 00:14:02.550
It's okay to rush forward.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.730
My rush of feelings

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:08.520
won't be stopped, just because 
Railcar's effect is sealed!

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:12.650
I overlay Level 4 Ruffian Railcar

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:16.870
and Express Train Trolley Olley!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.390
Impregnable fortress, send tremors 
through the ground,

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:27.010
as you barrel down the tracks 
where enemy soldiers squirm!

00:14:27.980 --> 00:14:29.680
Xyz Summon!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:34.890
Appear, Rank 4 Heavy Armored Train Ironwolf!

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:39.480
In that instant, the use of Trolley 
Olley as an Xyz component

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.350
increases Ironwolf's attack points by 800!

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:46.400
3000 attack points?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:47.580
I see.

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.900
If that attacks my Amazoness Queen...

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:54.990
...even if he can't destroy it, 
he can deal some damage.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.860
Basically the same thing we—

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:58.610
Like hell!

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:01.840
I won't play some stupid game of toying

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:06.350
with someone's monster, to shave 
down piddling life points!

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.640
Goodness me. "Toying," he says?

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.570
Then, what will you do?

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:14.330
I'm gonna smash right into you, of course!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:20.300
I use one of Ironwolf's Overlay Units 
to activate its monster effect!

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.540
Ironwolf can attack you directly!

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:29.900
I compliment you for attacking us directly, 
rather than our monsters.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:34.070
It must have taken all your meager 
intelligence to work that one out.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.360
As a reward, let us tell you one thing.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:39.280
That attack will not reach us.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:40.020
What?

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:45.300
Amazoness Pet Liger can negate 
attacks to targets other than itself.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.200
And even if you attack Liger,

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:52.430
Amazoness Queen's effect 
prevents its destruction.

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.000
Once again, your thinking proved too shallow.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:59.240
Damn... Isn't there something I can do?

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:02.440
Can't... Can't we do something?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.370
Allen...

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.780
Allen!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.880
Use Fairy Cheer Girl's effect!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.350
That's right!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:21.290
I use one of Fairy Cheer Girl's Overlay 
Units to activate its monster effect!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:24.260
Yeah! Now you can draw again!

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.730
Yeah!

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:32.140
Okay, let's go!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.440
Draw!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:39.180
I got it.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:43.320
Go. Battle, Ironwolf...

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:47.350
Full speed ahead at Amazoness Pet Liger!

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:51.290
I activate my trap Amazoness Substitution!

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:55.470
I Special Summon one Amazoness 
monster, of Level 4 or below,

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.500
and switch your attack target to that.

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:00.200
Come, Amazoness Swords Woman!

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.900
I dunno what you're trying to do,

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:09.170
but a train in motion won't stop so easily!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.410
I activate my Quick-Play Spell Limiter Removal!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:17.210
Until the end of my turn, it doubles 
Ironwolf's attack points!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.320
Allen...

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.290
Eat this!

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:28.460
In that instant, Amazoness Swords 
Woman's effect activates!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:32.430
The damage I would have taken 
in battle is dealt back to you!

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.720
Back to me?

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.030
I activate my set card!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.540
Fairy Rail!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.810
I use two Overlay Units on my field

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.410
to negate the damage Allen takes,

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.250
adding the damage you would have dealt 
to Fairy Cheer Girl's attack points!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.840
What? Our 4500 damage is...

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.480
...changed to attack points?

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:56.680
Allen, use my Cheer Girl!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:57.720
All right!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:02.190
I attack Amazoness Pet Liger 
with Fairy Cheer Girl!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.980
Amazoness Queen's effect prevents 
Liger's destruction!

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:09.730
But you still take damage!

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:15.870
Fairy Rail's effect means Fairy Cheer Girl

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:18.460
switches to defense position 
after damage calculation.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.240
Fairy Cheer Girl can't be destroyed by battle.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:26.160
And with her in defense position, 
we won't take damage.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:29.690
So you won't be able to hit us 
over and over, again!

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:32.160
Sayaka...

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.760
Allen, thanks for waking me up.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:40.870
You taught me that if I fight, I'd better 
keep at it until it really ends!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.580
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:46.100
I'm not giving up till it's over, either.

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.960
I now end my turn.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:54.110
During the End Phase, the monster that 
Limiter Removal targeted is destroyed!

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:57.660
Such an eyesore.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.360
Yes. Let's finish them off.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.650
My turn!

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:06.960
I activate spell card Polymerization 
from my hand,

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.630
to fuse Amazoness Queen and 
Amazoness Swords Woman.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.200
Queen of the jungle,

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:18.100
take on the gallant swords woman's power, 
and build an empire to reign over all.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.070
Fusion Summon!

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:24.330
Appear, Level 8 Amazoness Empress!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:30.550
Battle! Amazoness Pet Liger 
attacks Fairy Cheer Girl!

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.900
In that instant, Liger's attack 
points increase by 500.

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:38.060
Your attacks don't matter.

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:40.330
Fairy Cheer Girl can't be destroyed,

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.600
and you can't deal damage to defense-positi—

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:45.100
Amazoness Empress's monster effect!

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:49.070
When an Amazoness monster attacks 
a defense-position monster,

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.500
that monster deals piercing damage!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.510
I'll take off the remaining 1100 life, too.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:07.450
Amazoness Empress attacks Fairy Cheer Girl!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:17.660
Did you hear that?

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.600
Now, let's turn them into cards 
and head for the base.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:31.720
Yes.

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.280
Allen! Sayaka!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.010
Are you with Academia?!

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.220
Who are you two?

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:41.450
We're the Lancers!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.390
Oh? Then, let's try you.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:46.570
Yes...

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:50.150
That last duel wasn't satisfying at all.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.390
They're late... They're late.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.210
They're late... They're late!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.660
They're late!

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:08.590
They're now 28 minutes and 57 
seconds behind schedule.

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:11.370
Where are those Tyler sisters?

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:12.350
I have a report.

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:16.350
The Tyler sisters have engaged 
the Lancers in battle.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:17.390
What?

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:20.810
City cameras are picking
 up images of the duel.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:27.080
I'll inform the supreme commander at once.

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.130
W-Wait!

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:36.460
I mustn't let the commander know 
that I asked the Professor

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.840
to dispatch anti-Lancers duelists!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:42.600
I'll go and fetch the Tyler sisters myself.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:46.820
Until then, keep this a secret 
from the commander.

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:49.020
Understand?

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:57.270
Why couldn't I beat him?

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:03.480
Is it...

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:06.960
Is it because he's Yusyo Sakaki's...

00:22:08.900 --> 00:22:10.900
son?

00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:53.940
Are you the ones using an Amazoness 
deck for tag-team duels?

00:23:53.940 --> 00:23:59.210
The Spade Branch Resistance fought a pair of 
women who used an Amazoness deck,

00:23:59.210 --> 00:24:01.770
and were all but destroyed by them.

00:24:01.770 --> 00:24:03.820
I can't let them go!

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:07.260
I understand your sorrow and anger.

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:10.650
But I will fight the duel I believe in!

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:14.780
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Amazoness Trap.

00:24:15.330 --> 00:24:17.130
The fun is only getting started!
